     A                                      REF(SREFP)
     A          R PDNT01                    TEXT('DETAIL EOB NOTES WORKFILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*
     A            DNTXML        60A         COLHDG('XML FILE NAME')
     A*
     A            DNTCO#    R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A            DNTSUB#   R     S         REFFLD(SUB#)
     A            DNTFND    R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A            DNTFYR    R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A            DNTCASE   R     S         REFFLD(CASE)
     A            DNTEOB#   R     S         REFFLD(EOB#)
     A            DNTRCN#        3S 0       COLHDG('Recon Number')
     A            DNTEMP#   R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            DNTDIV    R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A            DNTDSEQ   R     S         REFFLD(A50)
     A                                      COLHDG('Detail Seq Number')
     A            DNTSEQ#   R     S         REFFLD(A50)
     A                                      COLHDG('Detail Line Number')
     A            DNTNOTE       70A         COLHDG('Detail EOB Note')
